ntially clash with\nother packages.\n\nWe only need to explicitly install it in the sdist.  The wheel still\nends up with a copy of the file in `shortuuid-*.dist-info/COPYING`, so\nno information is lost.", "tree": {"sha": "4603fcab3b544e76fa55319c06398d817855d2b2", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/git/trees/4603fcab3b544e76fa55319c06398d817855d2b2"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/git/commits/0455fb8b36a22a03c196f055736c9eaaa749b9fd", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/commits/0455fb8b36a22a03c196f055736c9eaaa749b9fd", "html_url": "https://github.com/skorokithakis/shortuuid/commit/0455fb8b36a22a03c196f055736c9eaaa749b9fd", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/skorokithakis/shortuuid/commits/0455fb8b36a22a03c196f055736c9eaaa749b9fd/comments", "author": {"login": "cjwatson", "id": 2429141, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI0MjkxNDE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2429141?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson", "html_url": "https://github.com/cjwatson", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/cjwatson/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "committer": {"login": "cjwatson", "i